flowchart LR
    target_resolution["target_resolution<br/>manager<br/>START"]
    planning["planning<br/>designer-reviewer<br/>WAITING FOR HUMAN"]
    implementation["implementation<br/>coder"]
    verification["verification<br/>designer-reviewer"]
    test_execution["test_execution<br/>command-runner"]
    debugging["debugging<br/>designer-reviewer"]
    independent_review["independent_review<br/>designer-reviewer"]
    ui_acceptance["ui_acceptance<br/>ui-acceptance-tester"]
    final_acceptance["final_acceptance<br/>designer-reviewer"]
    demo["demo<br/>designer-reviewer<br/>WAITING FOR HUMAN"]
    delivery["delivery<br/>command-runner"]
    deployment_verification["deployment_verification<br/>designer-reviewer"]
    deployment_debugging["deployment_debugging<br/>designer-reviewer"]
    closure["closure<br/>manager"]
    complete["complete<br/>manager<br/>COMPLETE"]
    recovery["recovery<br/>manager"]
    target_resolution -->|target_ready| planning
    planning -->|plan_ready| implementation
    planning -->|ticket_lookup_required| target_resolution
    planning -->|human_action_required · wait for human| planning
    implementation -->|implemented| verification
    verification -->|checks_selected| test_execution
    verification -->|checks_not_applicable| independent_review
    test_execution -->|checks_passed| independent_review
    test_execution -->|checks_failed| debugging
    debugging -->|correction_ready| implementation
    independent_review -->|changes_required| implementation
    independent_review -->|ui_required| ui_acceptance
    independent_review -->|ui_not_applicable| final_acceptance
    ui_acceptance -->|ui_accepted| final_acceptance
    ui_acceptance -->|changes_required| implementation
    final_acceptance -->|demo_required| demo
    final_acceptance -->|delivery_authorized| delivery
    final_acceptance -->|accepted_no_delivery| closure
    demo -->|demonstrated| final_acceptance
    demo -->|human_action_required · wait for human| demo
    demo -->|changes_required| implementation
    delivery -->|delivered| closure
    delivery -->|deployment_dispatched| deployment_verification
    deployment_verification -->|runtime_verified| closure
    deployment_verification -->|runtime_failed| deployment_debugging
    deployment_debugging -->|correction_ready| implementation
    closure -->|closed · terminal| complete
    closure -->|not_applicable · terminal| complete
    recovery -->|resumed| $resumeStage
    classDef start fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,color:#1e3a8a
    classDef waiting fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f
    classDef done fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d
    class target_resolution start
    class planning waiting
    class demo waiting
    class complete done
